## How the three platforms fit together

- **ECO-Light** (Hebei University): a controlled single-site experiment that reveals mechanisms.
- **Grassland transect**: a cross-regional experiment that tests how general the effects are and under which conditions they hold.
- **Urban–rural transect**: a survey of insect community composition and plant–insect interactions along real light-pollution gradients.

With identical sampling equipment, the three can be analysed together to understand how artificial light at night affects insect community composition and plant–insect interactions.
